{%- comment -%}
  NF-MENU-PICKS (2026-10-22, owner: "put a lot prettier images for every single option ... absolute beauties").
  Hand picked photo per menu collection, all from the store's own active product media (room / dusk shots, no white
  background cut outs, spec sheets or AI images). Prints one line: ,key=files/<file>, ...  where key is a collection
  handle or a page path. Callers capture the output of render 'nf-menu-picks' and split it:
  snippets/nf-menu-img-map.liquid (drawer rows, tiles), snippets/header-sidebar.liquid (#nfd-hero-map, panel heroes) and
  sections/nf-coll-mod.liquid (collection page tiles). Served same origin as /cdn/shop/<path>?width=N.
  To change a photo: replace the file name after the handle. To drop a pick: delete its key=value pair (the collection
  image is used again). Product per pick: docs/menu-images-plan.md.
{%- endcomment -%}
